<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: ate twisted meat -->
  <AteTwistedMeat.stages.ate_twisted_meat.label>comeu carne torcida</AteTwistedMeat.stages.ate_twisted_meat.label>
  <!-- EN: It was so gristly and stringy - like eating cancer. I want to throw up. -->
  <AteTwistedMeat.stages.ate_twisted_meat.description>Foi tão duro e rigoroso - como comer câncer. Quero vomitar.</AteTwistedMeat.stages.ate_twisted_meat.description>
  <!-- EN: {0} became a ghoul -->
  <BecameGhoul.stages.became_a_ghoul.label>{0} tornou-se um ghoul</BecameGhoul.stages.became_a_ghoul.label>
  <!-- EN: That vacant look… Are they even in there anymore? -->
  <BecameGhoul.stages.became_a_ghoul.description>Aquele olhar vago... Já lá estão?</BecameGhoul.stages.became_a_ghoul.description>
  <!-- EN: bliss lobotomy -->
  <BlissLobotomy.stages.bliss_lobotomy.label>lobotomia da felicidade</BlissLobotomy.stages.bliss_lobotomy.label>
  <!-- EN: Happy... good... happy... warm... -->
  <BlissLobotomy.stages.bliss_lobotomy.description>Feliz... bom... feliz... quente...</BlissLobotomy.stages.bliss_lobotomy.description>
  <!-- EN: observed chimera -->
  <Chimera.stages.observed_chimera.label>quimera observada</Chimera.stages.observed_chimera.label>
  <!-- EN: That misshapen creature, the cracked whorled flesh... horrifying. -->
  <Chimera.stages.observed_chimera.description>Aquela criatura maligna, a carne destroçada... horrível.</Chimera.stages.observed_chimera.description>
  <!-- EN: closed the void -->
  <ClosedTheVoid.stages.closed_the_void.label>fechar o vazio</ClosedTheVoid.stages.closed_the_void.label>
  <!-- EN: I can't believe it's finally over. -->
  <ClosedTheVoid.stages.closed_the_void.description>Não acredito que finalmente acabou.</ClosedTheVoid.stages.closed_the_void.description>
  <!-- EN: closed the void -->
  <ClosedTheVoidOpinion.stages.closed_the_void.label>fechar o vazio</ClosedTheVoidOpinion.stages.closed_the_void.label>
  <!-- EN: unnatural darkness lifted -->
  <DarknessLifted.stages.unnatural_darkness_lifted.label>trevas não naturais levantadas</DarknessLifted.stages.unnatural_darkness_lifted.label>
  <!-- EN: It's finally gone! I can breathe again. -->
  <DarknessLifted.stages.unnatural_darkness_lifted.description>Finalmente desapareceu! Consigo respirar outra vez.</DarknessLifted.stages.unnatural_darkness_lifted.description>
  <!-- EN: embraced the void -->
  <EmbracedTheVoid.stages.embraced_the_void.label>abraçado o vazio</EmbracedTheVoid.stages.embraced_the_void.label>
  <!-- EN: This is just the beginning. -->
  <EmbracedTheVoid.stages.embraced_the_void.description>Este é apenas o começo.</EmbracedTheVoid.stages.embraced_the_void.description>
  <!-- EN: healed me -->
  <HealedMe.stages.healed_me.label>curou-me</HealedMe.stages.healed_me.label>
  <!-- EN: {0} rambling -->
  <HeardInhumanRambling.stages.rambling.label>não</HeardInhumanRambling.stages.rambling.label>
  <!-- EN: {OTHERPAWN_nameDef} is talking nonsense. Is {OTHERPAWN_pronoun} insane? -->
  <HeardInhumanRambling.stages.rambling.description>Está a falar de disparates. É louco?</HeardInhumanRambling.stages.rambling.description>
  <!-- EN: mutated my arm -->
  <MutatedMyArm.stages.mutated_my_arm.label>mutado meu braço</MutatedMyArm.stages.mutated_my_arm.label>
  <!-- EN: obelisk abduction -->
  <ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-0.label>abdução de obelisco</ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-0.label>
  <!-- EN: That horrible thing imprisoned me! -->
  <ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-0.description>Aquela coisa horrível prendeu-me!</ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-0.description>
  <!-- EN: obelisk abduction -->
  <ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-1.label>abdução de obelisco</ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-1.label>
  <!-- EN: The sacred obelisk chose me! -->
  <ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-1.description>O obelisco sagrado escolheu-me!</ObeliskAbduction.stages.obelisk_abduction-1.description>
  <!-- EN: cube joy -->
  <PlayedWithCube.stages.cube_joy.label>alegria de cubo</PlayedWithCube.stages.cube_joy.label>
  <!-- EN: My wonderful cube. My precious cube. I love it. It's so beautiful. -->
  <PlayedWithCube.stages.cube_joy.description>O meu cubo maravilhoso. O meu precioso cubo. Adoro. É tão lindo.</PlayedWithCube.stages.cube_joy.description>
  <!-- EN: {RITUAL} guilt -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-0.label>A culpa</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-0.label>
  <!-- EN: It feels wrong to have participated in that ritual. -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-0.description>Parece errado ter participado nesse ritual.</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-0.description>
  <!-- EN: {RITUAL} guilt -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-1.label>A culpa</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-1.label>
  <!-- EN: That ritual was a crime against its victim. I shouldn't have been there. -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-1.description>Esse ritual foi um crime contra a vítima. Não devia ter estado lá.</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-1.description>
  <!-- EN: {RITUAL} guilt -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-2.label>A culpa</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-2.label>
  <!-- EN: That ritual was nothing short of torture. It's evil! -->
  <PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-2.description>Esse ritual não foi nada menos que tortura. É mau!</PsychicRitualGuilt.stages.guilt-2.description>
  <!-- EN: psychic ritual victim -->
  <PsychicRitualVictim.stages.psychic_ritual_victim.label>vítima ritual psíquico</PsychicRitualVictim.stages.psychic_ritual_victim.label>
  <!-- EN: They used me for their twisted ceremony. I'll never forget that horrid chanting. -->
  <PsychicRitualVictim.stages.psychic_ritual_victim.description>Usaram-me para a cerimónia distorcida. Nunca esquecerei aquele canto horrível.</PsychicRitualVictim.stages.psychic_ritual_victim.description>
  <!-- EN: unnatural corpse is angry -->
  <UnnaturalCorpseDestroyed.stages.unnatural_corpse_is_angry.label>cadáver não natural está zangado</UnnaturalCorpseDestroyed.stages.unnatural_corpse_is_angry.label>
  <!-- EN: I can still feel the corpse. It's out there. It's thinking of me. It hates me. -->
  <UnnaturalCorpseDestroyed.stages.unnatural_corpse_is_angry.description>Ainda sinto o cadáver. Está lá fora. Está a pensar em mim. Odeia-me.</UnnaturalCorpseDestroyed.stages.unnatural_corpse_is_angry.description>
  <!-- EN: void catharsis -->
  <VoidCatharsis.stages.void_catharsis.label>catharse vazia</VoidCatharsis.stages.void_catharsis.label>
  <!-- EN: There was a madness building in my mind. It's gone, for now. -->
  <VoidCatharsis.stages.void_catharsis.description>Havia um edifício de loucura na minha mente. Desapareceu, por agora.</VoidCatharsis.stages.void_catharsis.description>
  <!-- EN: void closed -->
  <VoidClosed.stages.void_closed.label>vazio fechado</VoidClosed.stages.void_closed.label>
  <!-- EN: We can sleep easier now. Those things won't be coming back any time soon. -->
  <VoidClosed.stages.void_closed.description>Podemos dormir mais facilmente agora. Essas coisas não voltarão em breve.</VoidClosed.stages.void_closed.description>
  <!-- EN: Void curiosity -->
  <VoidCuriosity.stages.Void_curiosity.label>Curiosidade do Void</VoidCuriosity.stages.Void_curiosity.label>
  <!-- EN: We should perform a void provocation ritual. Who knows what phenomena we might discover? -->
  <VoidCuriosity.stages.Void_curiosity.description>Devíamos fazer um ritual de provocação. Quem sabe que fenômenos podemos descobrir?</VoidCuriosity.stages.Void_curiosity.description>
  <!-- EN: Void curiosity satisfied -->
  <VoidCuriositySatisfied.stages.Void_curiosity_satisfied.label>A curiosidade do Void satisfeito</VoidCuriositySatisfied.stages.Void_curiosity_satisfied.label>
  <!-- EN: I regret nothing. -->
  <VoidCuriositySatisfied.stages.Void_curiosity_satisfied.description>Não me arrependo de nada.</VoidCuriositySatisfied.stages.Void_curiosity_satisfied.description>
